MATRIX: Wealth grind. A small compounding loop.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

BUGATTI wealth EQUALS 1000
BUGATTI day EQUALS 1

GRIND WHILE day IS LESS THAN 8
  BUGATTI wealth EQUALS wealth PLUS wealth DIVIDED BY 10
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Day " PLUS day PLUS ": wealth is " PLUS wealth
  BUGATTI day EQUALS day PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

IF wealth IS GREATER THAN 1500 THEN
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Matrix escaped. Bugatti acquired."
OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Keep grinding."
PERIOD

BACK TO THE MATRIX
